login more carefully to see what's actually going on.\\n\\nI'm examining the full JWT payload to verify it against different secrets and figure out which one the system is actually using. Or maybe I should just test whether the original token still works after logout to confirm the API behavior.\",\"signature\":\"\"}","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:00:30.307Z"}}
